{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>RecallNote 是一款結合學習、複習與筆記的應用程式，協助你記錄所學、反覆重溫，並為考試做好準備，適合應付認證考試、公務員考試、學校測驗、語言學習與詞彙背誦的人士。原價 US $12.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>間隔重複鞏固長期記憶</h2>\n<p>RecallNote 以遺忘曲線為基礎設計間隔重複，在你忘記之前提醒重溫，建立更穩固的長期記憶，並可追蹤記憶保留率與複習次數。你可以手寫或文字建立複習卡，省去輸入科目與標題；考試前開啟考試準備模式快速溫習。程式支援匯入 PDF 標註筆記，擷取內容即可建立複習卡，並以通知提醒按時複習。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-91-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-92-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-93-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-94-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-95-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-96-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：RecallNote</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T19:58:18.748453+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}